# Alpine Linux packages for the optional Chromium root (build-chromium-root.sh),
# which also carries the application ladder (batch 10, at the end):
# Alpine's chromium and every package it needs to start, except mesa,
# mesa-dri-gallium (with LLVM; software rendering needs neither), gtk+3.0
# or gtk4.0 and xdg-utils (desktop integration). update-pins.py brings the
# versions up to date when Alpine replaced a package. chromium-swiftshader is the software
# Vulkan driver behind ANGLE (SwANGLE), Chromium's GPU path without a GPU.
# Same format as alpine.pins.
